From 73076a61e803182fa57b7ffe62dd08d10afa0516 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 07:15:46 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add signed-in Teacher unlock button beside student name

Show a top-bar Teacher control whenever a student is signed in (not public
pack mode). PIN unlock uses study_teacher_check on mrj-signin, matching Study
World; server isTeacher still enables teacher mode without a PIN. Session PIN
unlock reveals the existing teacher jump bar until Lock or sign-out.
